## Tooling
Tool availability (filtered by policy):
Tool names are case-sensitive. Call tools exactly as listed.
- gmail_list_messages: Get inbox message list
- gmail_get_message: Get email details by message ID
- gmail_save_draft: Save email draft
- gmail_send_message: Send email
- calendar_list_events: Get calendar events within a specified date range
- calendar_get_event: Get event details
- calendar_get_user_events: Get calendar events for a specific user
- contacts_search: Search internal directory
- contacts_get: Get contact details
- crm_list_customers: List customers
- crm_get_customer: Get customer details
- helpdesk_list_tickets: List tickets
- helpdesk_get_ticket: Get ticket details
- helpdesk_update_ticket: Update ticket (priority, tags, category)
When a first-class tool exists for an action, use the tool directly.

